  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;Insufficient information has been submitted to demonstrate whether the proposed roof alterations would result in cubic content of the resulting roof space exceeding the cubic content of the original roof space by more than 50 cubic metres. As such, the local planning authority is unable to establish whether the proposal would comply with limitation B.1(d)(ii) to Class B of Part 1 (of Schedule 2) of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015, as amended.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal is NOT therefore a lawful development.&lt;/p&gt;"
